  "instructions": [
    "Heat a comal over medium heat.",
    "Add a tablespoon of coconut oil and cook until melted.",
    "Add the chopped red onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the chopped red bell pepper and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the ground pork and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add the chili flakes and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the lime juice, honey, flaxseed meal, flour, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chopped scotch bonnet peppers and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving dish and garnish with additional scotch bonnet peppers if desired.",
    "Cook pork to an internal temperature of 63°C / 145°F and let it rest for 3 minutes before serving."
